## Key Learning Outcomes

This project helped me practise a complete machine learning workflow. I learned how to prepare data, compare models, interpret classification results, and select a model using appropriate evaluation metrics.

It also helped me understand that high accuracy can be misleading when the dataset is imbalanced. This is why I used Macro F1, Balanced Accuracy, and the confusion matrix to support my model selection.

